WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.210
Quick: what number is
«quatre-vingt-dix-sept»?

2
00:00:03.210 --> 00:00:06.620
Four, twenty, ten, seven.

3
00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:08.770
Now hear it at natural speed:

4
00:00:08.770 --> 00:00:11.500
«de soixante-dix-sept à
quatre-vingt-dix-sept pour cent».

5
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:13.230
And in Belgium or Switzerland,

6
00:00:13.230 --> 00:00:16.100
you might hear «nonante» instead.

7
00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:18.130
Add a chart full of percentages,

8
00:00:18.130 --> 00:00:20.440
and 5 questions in French.

9
00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:23.650
So how do you catch what
matters in fast French,

10
00:00:23.650 --> 00:00:25.560
and match it to the numbers?

11
00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:29.150
In this mission, you'll take
a chart apart in four steps.

12
00:00:29.150 --> 00:00:32.210
Then you'll map all five
listening task types,

13
00:00:32.210 --> 00:00:34.470
from interview to presentation.

14
00:00:34.470 --> 00:00:37.650
Your mission: work out how
to answer five questions

15
00:00:37.650 --> 00:00:40.120
on one fast clip and one chart.
